### C.jet_secp_field_mul7.mul7_run_eq
mul7_run_eq
     : @eq (option jet_sx_exec.res) mul7_run (@Some jet_sx_exec.res (jet_sx_exec.RDone mul7_state jet_sx_exec.ONormal))
### C.jet_secp_field_mul7.mul7_return
